-- Passwords are hashed using BCrypt algorithm https://www.dailycred.com/article/bcrypt-calculator
-- Passwords for all users are: 123
--
-- Script generates  database for cultural offer app
-- It generates:
-- 	- 2 authorities
-- 	- 60 accounts
-- 		- 30 for administrators
-- 		- 30 for regular users
-- 	- 30 administrators
-- 	- 30 regular users
--
-- 	- 30 categories
-- 		- 20 of which have subcategories
-- 	- 60 subcategories
-- 		- 3 per category
--
-- 	- 1000 cultural offers
-- 		- 800 of which can have subscribers
-- 			- 33 per user
-- 		- 20 of which are highlighted
-- 			- with highlight level 20
--
-- 	- 3300 news
-- 		- for 580 non highlighted cultural offers
-- 			- 5 per cultural offer
-- 		- for 20 highlighted offers
-- 			- 20 per highlighted offer
-- 			- with highlight level 20
--
-- 	- 2800 reviews
-- 		- for 480 non highlighted cultural offers
-- 			- 5 per cultural offer
-- 		- for 20 highlighted offers
-- 			- 20 per highlighted offer
-- 			- with highlight level 20
-- 	- 2100 replies
--
-- 	- 20368 images
-- 		- 1760 for cultural offers
-- 			- for 680 non highlighted offers
-- 				- 2 per offer
-- 			- 20 highlighted offers
-- 				- 20 per offer
--
-- 		- 10075 for news
-- 			- for 2075 non highlighted news
-- 				- 1 per news
-- 			- for 400 highlighted news
-- 				- 20 per news
--
-- 		- 8533 for reviews
-- 			- for 533 non highlighted reviews
-- 				- 1 per review
-- 			- for 400 highlighted reviews
-- 				- 20 per review
--
